'''Zombie Outbreaks''' (ゾンビ襲来, ''Zonbi Shūrai'', '''Zombie Attack''') are [[Invasion Stage]]s that appear in completed [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapter]]s, starting with [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. This feature was introduced in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] of the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese Version]] on November 16th, 2016, with later updates adding them to other chapters:

