==Strategies==
*A decently-leveled [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] can prevent all peons from burrowing. Spam them to bypass all Zombies and destroy the base. Harder Outbreaks may require [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]] instead. This tactic will not work in harder stages, forcing you to use proper strategies.
*For an even faster method, use the Crazed Giraffe (or the [[Cat Cannon]]) to clear a path for [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] to destroy the enemy base in a couple hits. If correctly timed, he can easily bypass the burrowing zombies.
*Zombies will inevitably get behind your front lines as they revive or when new ones spawn, causing them to "snipe" your base from behind your forces. A helpful tactic to prevent this is to keep a [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]] at the ready for when new spawns burrow behind so that they can help to defend the base more easily. You really don't want to lose a base-race on a difficult [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/Zombie stage!
*Getting an early [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] specialist can help farm that +10 Cat Food for more units, as Zombie Outbreaks do get rather difficult starting from Empire of Cats Chapter 3 for newer players. There is a total of 480 Cat Food available from Zombie Outbreaks in each chapter. While not renewable, this remains as one of the more efficient ways for beginners to earn Cat Food.
**Early on, a good Zombie Killer to use is [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Wushu Cat]], a spammable, bulky anti-Zombie meatshield who also has good DPS, beating up Zombies easily. [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Vaulter Cat]] is also worth considering, having high range, good attack power and the ability to Slow Zombies, but her blind spot makes her susceptible to burrowing peons who can infiltrate said blind spot.
**All units from the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] Gacha Event have Zombie Killer and can easily decimate Zombies, making these expensive but powerful choices for new players.

