==Trivia==
*The time machine in [[Sir Rel]]'s Japanese description may explain how he appears in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3's Zombie Outbreaks.
*From [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]] to [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]], there was a feature to jump directly to an available Zombie Outbreak from the [[Cat Base Menu]].
*From an unknown version to [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], a glitch made it possible to unlock [[Takuya & Yuki (Rare Cat)|Takuya & Yuki]] by entering a Zombie Outbreak stage in Chapter 3 of [[Into the Future]], closing the app, then waiting a period between 30 minutes to 20 hours before re-opening the game and completing the stage.
*Prior to [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]], the randomizer that determines which stage an Outbreak appears in could choose a stage whose Outbreak had already been cleared, resulting in no Outbreak appearing. As a result, Outbreaks would occur less and less frequently as they were cleared.

